<title>USA: General Mills Inc Q3 Feb 23 net up.</title>
<headline>General Mills Inc Q3 Feb 23 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net			122,800		  116,300</p>
<p> Revs		   1,289,600		1,309,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 157,500		  159,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 net reduced by $0.02 a share by acquisition of branded cereal and snacks businesses from Ralcorp Holdings Inc.  </p>
<p>Q3 1997 loss from joint ventures $5.5 million vs $3.5 million in year-ago period ended February 25, 1996.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.40		    $2.51</p>
<p> Net			377,200		  398,900</p>
<p> Revs		   4,165,300		4,033,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 157,300		  158,800</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1997 nine-month results include non-cash charge of $48.4 million pretax ($29.2 million or $0.18 a share after tax) for accounting for impairmant of long-lived assets.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1997 loss from joint ventures $4.8 million vs $2.6 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
